heal
tp 12 12
face e
freeze on
editor place doors wooden_door 15 12
mappage close
opendoor 15 12
step 1
spawn mummy 16 12 west up
learn 2 fire
learn 2 project
learn 2 explode
setskill 2 fire 5
monsters
tally reset
cast 2 fire project explode
step 4
tally
monsters

