; end's closed end (rock at 13,12). A firebolt launched at him down the EMPTY
; front-right lane (`bolt`, slot 1) flies past him and breaks on the rock behind;
; its flight ends in his square, the last open one, and its burn catches him
; there. Before C44 the burn went to the rock's own square, where nobody stands,
; so only a bolt running out of reach in open air ever delivered one - which is
